      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%BA%9C%E7%B4%B0%E4%BA%9C%E5%A4%A7%E8%A6%B3_10_025_%22%E7%9F%B3%E5%88%BB%E3%81%AE%E4%BD%9B%E5%83%8F%22.jpg",
      "width": 1564,
